scene grandmas_cottage
  [[show backdrop ext_countryside_field with screenfade]]
  $: EXT. THE OLD VALLEY - MORNING

  The train stops at a platform with no name. A path leads down to a white cottage.

  [[show backdrop ext_countryside_cottage with fade over 1]]
  An old radio plays in the window. The song is *Moonlight on the Rails*.

  GRANDMA:
    (smiling)
    Rosa's friends, I expect. Every night I send that song down the line, so my granddaughter knows I'm still listening.

  ZADIE:
    [[zadie:sad]]
    She thinks her jukebox is haunted.

  GRANDMA:
    Then it's time I visited.

  // TODO: let the friends invite Grandma to the diner.

  if told_rosa then
    [[show backdrop ext_countryside_cottage_path with fade over 1]]
    Rosa steps off the next train, still in her apron.
  else
    IMANI:
      [[imani:happy]]
      I'll write Rosa your address. On a napkin, obviously.
  end

  [[show backdrop sky_sunset with fade over 2]]
  ^: THE END
  fin
end
